WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.616
Priya: Okay. Do one thing — cordon the node and drain it again.

2
00:00:05.616 --> 00:00:09.840
Sam: Draining. Then I downgrade kubelet.

3
00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:12.889
Priya: And roll back the config as well.

4
00:00:12.889 --> 00:00:16.417
Sam: Doing both. Five minutes.

5
00:00:16.417 --> 00:00:21.913
Sam: Node is back on one twenty-seven. Pods are starting.

6
00:00:21.913 --> 00:00:26.401
Priya: Let's cut a release for the config fix tonight, separately.

7
00:00:26.401 --> 00:00:30.409
Sam: Agreed. Keep the two changes apart.

8
00:00:30.409 --> 00:00:36.194
Priya: Exactly. One change, one release, one rollback.

9
00:00:36.194 --> 00:00:37.946
Sam: I'm on it.

10
00:00:37.946 --> 00:00:41.978
Priya: Good. Tell me when the pods are ready.

11
00:00:41.978 --> 00:00:43.610
Sam: Two minutes.

